      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/apistogramma-uaupesi-2/",
      "html": "<p>Apistogramma uaupesi is certainly one of the most beautiful dwarf cichlids. Adult males can be very variable in colour, therefore A. uaupesi has several German popular names, such as \"Rotkeil-Apistogramma\" or \"Blutkehl-Apistogramma\" (= Red Wedge and Blood Throat). In nature, however, all colour variants occur together, so it is not a matter of locality forms, but of an intraspecific polychromatism.</p>"
